# Build
dist/
# Any sibling build output too. An agent running an isolated
# `vite build --mode test` into dist-test/ left it untracked AND unignored on a
# PUBLIC repo, where one broad `git add` publishes a whole build.
dist-*/
# Playwright MCP scratch — page snapshots and console logs the browser tool
# writes into the repo root. Untracked AND unignored on a PUBLIC repo until
# 2026-09-18; it can hold rendered page content from whatever was being
# driven, including signed-in surfaces.
.playwright-mcp/
.cache/
.npm-cache/
tmp/
debug.log
# ...including the per-port subdirectories a PLAYWRIGHT_PORT run writes
# (tests/user-sim/report/<port>/) — the trailing slash covers them.
tests/user-sim/report/
test-results/
playwright-report/

